# D3-FE-003: Compare fresh and dry yeast on a dry-solids basis
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 50mL @ 30C
add v1 sucrose 1g
add v1 dry_yeast 0.30g
add v2 water 49.3mL @ 30C
add v2 sucrose 1g
add v2 fresh_yeast 1g
add v3 water 50mL @ 30C
add v3 sucrose 1g
add v3 fresh_yeast 0.30g
wait 5min
inspect
wait 55min
measure v1 balance
measure v2 balance
measure v3 balance
inspect
